-// TODO: there is no real session handling yet — the dashboard just picks the first user.
+// Links a Clerk account to an in-memory user record, matching on email so
+// someone already seeded above (e.g. "ada@example.com") lands on their
+// existing record instead of a duplicate. First-time sign-ins/sign-ups get a
